    "name": "Arthur & Susan: Almost Detectives",
    "steam_appid": 2629650,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629650/extras/523c57a7138d82607cf5754ead7f665e.avif?t=1710585812\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br>Arthur and Susan are the two main playable characters, offering unique perspectives. Decide who speaks and when, as each has their distinct way of tackling challenges.<br><br>30 captivating characters, each one with their own tales, motives and secrets. Each one is a puzzle on its own. Each one has a different text font and around 100 combination of body poses and face gestures that we have diligently defined, even if you'll only see a fraction!<br><br>More than 100 inventory items, that you will need to watch, use, give or combine in order to solve the countless logical puzzles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629650/extras/05953420673df5733760658b9ca235be.avif?t=1710585812\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br>No more straining your eyes! While the game offers a single difficulty, choose to wield the optional magnifying glass, revealing all interactable items in a scene. Say goodbye to pesky pixel hunting - unless you're into that!<br><br>An estimated 1000 jokes and puns sprinkled throughout your adventure.<br><br>Available in English and Spanish.<br><br>Have I said it's a funny, original and cozy point &amp; click indie game?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629650/extras/523c57a7138d82607cf5754ead7f665e.avif?t=1710585812\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br>Arthur and Susan are the two main playable characters, offering unique perspectives. Decide who speaks and when, as each has their distinct way of tackling challenges.<br><br>30 captivating characters, each one with their own tales, motives and secrets. Each one is a puzzle on its own. Each one has a different text font and around 100 combination of body poses and face gestures that we have diligently defined, even if you'll only see a fraction!<br><br>More than 100 inventory items, that you will need to watch, use, give or combine in order to solve the countless logical puzzles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629650/extras/05953420673df5733760658b9ca235be.avif?t=1710585812\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br>No more straining your eyes! While the game offers a single difficulty, choose to wield the optional magnifying glass, revealing all interactable items in a scene. Say goodbye to pesky pixel hunting - unless you're into that!<br><br>An estimated 1000 jokes and puns sprinkled throughout your adventure.<br><br>Available in English and Spanish.<br><br>Have I said it's a funny, original and cozy point &amp; click indie game?",
